          "message": {
            "text": "The warning contract is exercised through the real Node post-pass, not only its formatter. Focused tests pass 13/13 across exact isolation, planner miss, unresolved CDP owner, screenshot failure, and missing token; the Chromium E2E passes 2/2 and additionally proves an exact generated-pseudo boundary stays separate from the host and emits neither backdrop warning.",
            "markdown": "The warning contract is exercised through the real Node post-pass, not only its formatter. Focused tests pass 13/13 across exact isolation, planner miss, unresolved CDP owner, screenshot failure, and missing token; the Chromium E2E passes 2/2 and additionally proves an exact generated-pseudo boundary stays separate from the host and emits neither backdrop warning."
          },
